  "title": "Whittington Johnson & Ann Rust Norwood",
  "clean_html": "<html>\n<head>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<title>Whittington Johnson &amp; Ann Rust Norwood</title>\n</head>\n<body alink=\"#996600\" background=\"Wolfcreek2.jpg\" link=\"#003300\" text=\"#660000\" vlink=\"#993300\">\n<h1 align=\"center\"><font color=\"#0000FF\"><br/>\n</font></h1>\n<h1 align=\"center\"><br/>\n<font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">Descendants of </font></h1>\n<h1 align=\"center\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"5\">Whittington \n Johnson <br/>\n<br/>\n</font><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">born 1812 in Delaware<br/>\n grandson of Thomas Clark &amp; Elizabeth Morris<br/>\n<br/>\n</font><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">See <span class=\"preserved-document-text\">Preserved Mitsawokett Document</span></font><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">\n</font></h1>\n<h1 align=\"center\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">and his wife</font></h1>\n<h1 align=\"center\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"5\">Ann Rust Norwood<br/>\n<br/>\n<font size=\"3\">born abt 1815 in Delaware</font></font><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"5\"><font size=\"3\"><br/>\n daughter of Eli Norwood &amp; Anna Rust</font></font></h1>\n<h1 align=\"center\"><br/>\n<font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b><font color=\"#660000\">Some \n of the information in this report has been reported to us orally or by \n by <b>members of the Mitsawokett research group</b>, <u>without documentation</u>.<br/>\n<br/>\n This report should be used as a guide to further research, not as a definitive \n report</font></b> </font></h1>\n<p> <font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br/>\n</font>\n<center>\n</center>\n<center>\n<center>\n<p>\u00a0 \n <p><i><font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\"><font size=\"-1\">The personal data of living \n individuals is not displayed</font></font></i> <br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n</p></p></center>\n<p>\n<center>\n \u00a0 <font color=\"#0000FF\"></font>\n<font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\"><font size=\"-1\"><br/>\n<br/>\n</font></font>\n</center>\n<center>\n<center>\n</center>\n</center>\n<ul>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<center>\n<center>\n<center>\n<ul>\n<center><center>\n<p><font color=\"#0000FF\" face=\"Arial, Times New Roman, Helvetica\" size=\"-1\">\n</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" height=\"46\" width=\"75%\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<center>\n<center>\n<center>\n<p><br/>\n<center>\n<p><font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\"><u><font size=\"5\"><b>Table \n of Contents</b><br/>\n</font><br/>\n</u></font></p>\n</center>\n</p></center>\n<center>\n<font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\"><a href=\"pafg01.htm\"><b><font size=\"4\">DESCENDANTS</font></b></a></font>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"4\"><b><a href=\"index2.htm\">SURNAME \n LIST</a></b></font><font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\"><a href=\"pafg01.htm\"><b></b></a></font><br/>\n<br/>\n<font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"4\"><b><a href=\"index3.htm\">NAME \n INDEX</a></b></font><br/>\n</center>\n<center>\n<p>\n<center>\n<center>\n</center>\n<p><font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"4\"><b> </b>\n</font> </p>\n</center>\n<p>\n<center>\n<font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"4\"><b> </b> </font>\n</center>\n</p></p></center>\n</center>\n<p>\n<center>\n<center>\n<center>\n<p><font face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"4\"><span class=\"preserved-document-text\"> \n RETURN TO FAMILY HISTORY MENU </span><br/>\n<br/>\n</font></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</center>\n</center>\n</center>\n<p>\n<center>\n<p>\n<center>\n</center>\n</p>\n</center>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"#660000\"><br/>\n</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#660000\"><b><br/>\n</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <font color=\"#660000\"><span class=\"preserved-document-text\">MAIN \n MENU\n</span><b><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><br/>\n</font></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <font color=\"#660000\"><b><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">\u00a0</font>\n</b><span class=\"preserved-document-text\">\n US</span> <br/>\n<br/>\n</font>\n</p></center>\n</div>\n</p></p></center>\n<center>\n<p>\u00a0 </p>\n<table border=\"5\" bordercolor=\"#660000\" width=\"70%\">\n<tr bordercolor=\"#0000FF\">\n<td bordercolor=\"#003300\">\n<p align=\"center\">\u00a0</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\"><span class=\"preserved-document-text\">MITSAWOKETT \n </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><b>\"The \n History and Genealogy of the <br/>\n Native American Isolate Communities<br/>\n of Kent County, Delaware, and<br/>\n Surrounding Areas on the Delmarva Peninsula<br/>\n and Southern New Jersey\" <br/>\n<br/>\n</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\">\u00a0</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><b><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"5\">Copyright \n 1997-</font><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, \n\nsans-serif\" size=\"5\">\n<script language=\"javascript\" type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar today = new Date()\nvar year = today.getFullYear()\ndocument.write(year)\n</script>\n</font></b><br/>\n<font color=\"#660000\"><b><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">All \n rights reserved. <br/>\n Not to be used for commercial purposes. </font></b></font></p>\n</center>\n<br/>\n<font color=\"#660000\"></font><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\">\n<br/>\n</font><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"-1\"><br/>\n</font></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p align=\"center\">\u00a0</p>\n</center>\n</center></ul>\n</center>\n</center>\n</center></div>\n</ul>\n</p></center></p></body>\n</html>",
  "text_content": "Whittington Johnson & Ann Rust Norwood\nDescendants of\nWhittington \n Johnson\nborn 1812 in Delaware\ngrandson of Thomas Clark & Elizabeth Morris\nSee\nPreserved Mitsawokett Document\nand his wife\nAnn Rust Norwood\nborn abt 1815 in Delaware\ndaughter of Eli Norwood & Anna Rust\nSome \n of the information in this report has been reported to us orally or by \nby\nmembers of the Mitsawokett research group\n,\nwithout documentation\n.\nThis report should be used as a guide to further research, not as a definitive \n report\nThe personal data of living \n individuals is not displayed\nTable \n of Contents\nDESCENDANTS\nSURNAME \n LIST\nNAME \n INDEX\nRETURN TO FAMILY HISTORY MENU\nMAIN \n MENU\n\n US\nMITSAWOKETT\n\"The \n History and Genealogy of the\nNative American Isolate Communities\nof Kent County, Delaware, and\nSurrounding Areas on the Delmarva Peninsula\nand Southern New Jersey\"\nCopyright \n 1997-\nAll \n rights reserved.\nNot to be used for commercial purposes.",
